    {
      "id": "sh6",
      "type": "static-html",
      "section": 1,
      "position": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 504
      },
      "title": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Game: serval pounce"
        },
        {
          "lang": "pt",
          "text": "Jogo: o salto do serval"
        }
      ],
      "content": {
        "item": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:auto;color:#222\">\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">Serval pounce</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">The serval is a long-legged wild cat of the African savanna, with the largest ears for its size of any cat. It hunts rodents hidden in tall grass by <em>listening</em> for them, then leaps high in the air and lands on its prey with its front paws. Servals catch their prey in about half of their pounces, one of the best success rates among cats.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><b>How to play:</b> when a tuft of grass rustles, a rodent is hiding there. Click (or tap) it quickly to pounce! Pouncing on quiet grass counts as a miss. You have 30 seconds, and the rodents get faster as you catch more.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:#f5f0e8;border-radius:8px;padding:6px;font-size:15px\"><span>⏱ <b id=\"t\">30</b> s</span><span>🐭 Caught: <b id=\"c\">0</b></span><span>🐾 Pounces: <b id=\"p\">0</b></span></div>\n<div id=\"field\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><button id=\"start\">Start hunting</button></div>\n<div id=\"msg\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:10px;min-height:3em;line-height:1.5\"></div>\n</div>\n<style>\n#field{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(#e6d39b,#b99d55);border-radius:12px;margin:10px 0;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.tuft{position:relative;height:84px;border-radius:50% 50% 12px 12px;background:#c8ad62;font-size:38px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation;transition:background .15s;box-shadow:inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n.tuft.rustle{animation:shake .12s infinite;background:#ead27f}\n@keyframes shake{0%{transform:rotate(-4deg)}50%{transform:rotate(4deg)}100%{transform:rotate(-4deg)}}\n.pop{position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;font-size:30px;pointer-events:none;animation:up .7s forwards}\n@keyframes up{from{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,10px)}to{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-24px)}}\n#start{padding:8px 22px;font-size:15px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:#b8862b;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}\n#start:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}\n</style>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar field=document.getElementById('field'),tEl=document.getElementById('t'),cEl=document.getElementById('c'),pEl=document.getElementById('p'),msg=document.getElementById('msg'),btn=document.getElementById('start');\nvar tufts=[],active=-1,last=-1,caught=0,pounces=0,escaped=0,best=0,running=false,endT=0,hideTO=null,nextTO=null,tick=null;\nfor(var i=0;i<9;i++){(function(k){var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='tuft';d.innerHTML='<span>🌾🌾</span>';d.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault();hit(k);});field.appendChild(d);tufts.push(d);})(i);}\nfunction pop(k,s){var e=document.createElement('span');e.className='pop';e.textContent=s;tufts[k].appendChild(e);setTimeout(function(){if(e.parentNode)e.parentNode.removeChild(e);},700);}\nfunction win(){return Math.max(500,1100-caught*25);}\nfunction next(){if(!running)return;var k;do{k=Math.floor(Math.random()*9);}while(k===last);last=k;active=k;tufts[k].classList.add('rustle');\n hideTO=setTimeout(function(){tufts[k].classList.remove('rustle');if(active===k){active=-1;escaped++;pop(k,'💨');}nextTO=setTimeout(next,200+Math.random()*500);},win());}\nfunction hit(k){if(!running)return;pounces++;\n if(k===active){caught++;active=-1;clearTimeout(hideTO);tufts[k].classList.remove('rustle');pop(k,'🐭');nextTO=setTimeout(next,250+Math.random()*450);}\n else{pop(k,'❌');}\n cEl.textContent=caught;pEl.textContent=pounces;}\nfunction end(){running=false;clearTimeout(hideTO);clearTimeout(nextTO);clearInterval(tick);active=-1;\n tufts.forEach(function(t){t.classList.remove('rustle');});tEl.textContent='0';\n var rate=pounces?Math.round(caught/pounces*100):0;if(caught>best)best=caught;\n var verdict=pounces===0?'You never pounced, so every rodent got away!':rate>=75?'Superb! Your success rate beats a real serval.':rate>=45?'About as good as a real serval.':'Real servals do better: they wait and listen before they leap.';\n msg.innerHTML='<b>'+caught+'</b> rodents caught in <b>'+pounces+'</b> pounces (success rate <b>'+rate+'%</b>), '+escaped+' got away.<br>'+verdict+'<br>Best this session: <b>'+best+'</b>';\n btn.textContent='Hunt again';btn.disabled=false;}\nbtn.onclick=function(){caught=0;pounces=0;escaped=0;last=-1;active=-1;cEl.textContent='0';pEl.textContent='0';tEl.textContent='30';\n msg.textContent='Listen… watch for the grass that rustles!';running=true;btn.disabled=true;endT=Date.now()+30000;\n tick=setInterval(function(){var left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((endT-Date.now())/1000));tEl.textContent=left;if(left<=0)end();},100);\n nextTO=setTimeout(next,700);};\n})();\n</script>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "pt",
            "text": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:auto;color:#222\">\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">O salto do serval</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">O serval é um felino selvagem de pernas longas da savana africana, com as maiores orelhas em relação ao tamanho do corpo entre todos os felinos. Ele caça roedores escondidos no capim alto <em>escutando</em> seus ruídos, depois salta alto no ar e cai sobre a presa com as patas dianteiras. Os servais capturam a presa em cerca de metade dos saltos, uma das maiores taxas de sucesso entre os felinos.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><b>Como jogar:</b> quando uma moita de capim balançar, há um roedor escondido ali. Clique (ou toque) nela depressa para dar o bote! Saltar sobre capim parado conta como erro. Você tem 30 segundos, e os roedores ficam mais rápidos à medida que você captura mais.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:#f5f0e8;border-radius:8px;padding:6px;font-size:15px\"><span>⏱ <b id=\"t\">30</b> s</span><span>🐭 Capturas: <b id=\"c\">0</b></span><span>🐾 Saltos: <b id=\"p\">0</b></span></div>\n<div id=\"field\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><button id=\"start\">Começar a caçar</button></div>\n<div id=\"msg\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:10px;min-height:3em;line-height:1.5\"></div>\n</div>\n<style>\n#field{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(#e6d39b,#b99d55);border-radius:12px;margin:10px 0;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.tuft{position:relative;height:84px;border-radius:50% 50% 12px 12px;background:#c8ad62;font-size:38px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation;transition:background .15s;box-shadow:inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n.tuft.rustle{animation:shake .12s infinite;background:#ead27f}\n@keyframes shake{0%{transform:rotate(-4deg)}50%{transform:rotate(4deg)}100%{transform:rotate(-4deg)}}\n.pop{position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;font-size:30px;pointer-events:none;animation:up .7s forwards}\n@keyframes up{from{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,10px)}to{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-24px)}}\n#start{padding:8px 22px;font-size:15px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:#b8862b;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}\n#start:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}\n</style>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar field=document.getElementById('field'),tEl=document.getElementById('t'),cEl=document.getElementById('c'),pEl=document.getElementById('p'),msg=document.getElementById('msg'),btn=document.getElementById('start');\nvar tufts=[],active=-1,last=-1,caught=0,pounces=0,escaped=0,best=0,running=false,endT=0,hideTO=null,nextTO=null,tick=null;\nfor(var i=0;i<9;i++){(function(k){var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='tuft';d.innerHTML='<span>🌾🌾</span>';d.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault();hit(k);});field.appendChild(d);tufts.push(d);})(i);}\nfunction pop(k,s){var e=document.createElement('span');e.className='pop';e.textContent=s;tufts[k].appendChild(e);setTimeout(function(){if(e.parentNode)e.parentNode.removeChild(e);},700);}\nfunction win(){return Math.max(500,1100-caught*25);}\nfunction next(){if(!running)return;var k;do{k=Math.floor(Math.random()*9);}while(k===last);last=k;active=k;tufts[k].classList.add('rustle');\n hideTO=setTimeout(function(){tufts[k].classList.remove('rustle');if(active===k){active=-1;escaped++;pop(k,'💨');}nextTO=setTimeout(next,200+Math.random()*500);},win());}\nfunction hit(k){if(!running)return;pounces++;\n if(k===active){caught++;active=-1;clearTimeout(hideTO);tufts[k].classList.remove('rustle');pop(k,'🐭');nextTO=setTimeout(next,250+Math.random()*450);}\n else{pop(k,'❌');}\n cEl.textContent=caught;pEl.textContent=pounces;}\nfunction end(){running=false;clearTimeout(hideTO);clearTimeout(nextTO);clearInterval(tick);active=-1;\n tufts.forEach(function(t){t.classList.remove('rustle');});tEl.textContent='0';\n var rate=pounces?Math.round(caught/pounces*100):0;if(caught>best)best=caught;\n var verdict=pounces===0?'Você não saltou nenhuma vez, e todos os roedores escaparam!':rate>=75?'Excelente! Sua taxa de acerto supera a de um serval de verdade.':rate>=45?'Quase tão bom quanto um serval de verdade.':'Servais de verdade se saem melhor: eles esperam e escutam antes de saltar.';\n msg.innerHTML='<b>'+caught+'</b> roedores capturados em <b>'+pounces+'</b> saltos (taxa de acerto de <b>'+rate+'%</b>), '+escaped+' escaparam.<br>'+verdict+'<br>Melhor resultado nesta sessão: <b>'+best+'</b>';\n btn.textContent='Caçar de novo';btn.disabled=false;}\nbtn.onclick=function(){caught=0;pounces=0;escaped=0;last=-1;active=-1;cEl.textContent='0';pEl.textContent='0';tEl.textContent='30';\n msg.textContent='Escute… fique atento ao capim que balança!';running=true;btn.disabled=true;endT=Date.now()+30000;\n tick=setInterval(function(){var left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((endT-Date.now())/1000));tEl.textContent=left;if(left<=0)end();},100);\n nextTO=setTimeout(next,700);};\n})();\n</script>"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
